==Trivia==
*The creature appears to be both based on and named after 'Catoblepas' (from the Greek καταβλέπω, (katablépō) "to look downwards," due to their head shape.) It is a mythical cow-like creature from real-world ancient Nubia, thought to have originated from encounters with wildebeest.

